<Base title="How We List Tools" description="How RecruitPicks checks AI recruiting tools, pricing and partner programs." path="/about/">
<div class="hero left"><h1>How we list tools</h1><p>RecruitPicks is an independent directory of AI tools for recruiters.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="max-width:760px"><ul>
<li><b>Source of truth:</b> every listing is checked against the vendor's own website. Pricing is copied as shown; if none is published we write “Contact for pricing”.</li>
<li><b>Last checked:</b> each tool page shows the date it was last verified.</li>
<li><b>Ranking:</b> tools are ordered by category fit and completeness of verified information (public pricing, clear use case, features). Commercial relationships never affect order.</li>
<li><b>Partners:</b> some vendors run partner programs. These are labelled “Partner”, and we may earn a commission if you buy through our links, at no extra cost to you.</li>
<li><b>Sponsored placements</b> will always be clearly labelled and never change reviews or comparison data.</li>
<li><b>Corrections:</b> vendors and readers can request updates via the submit page.</li>
</ul></div>
</Base>
